1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,119
Why are you here?

2
00:00:12,799 --> 00:00:14,479
I heard it.

3
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,080
Heard what?

4
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:27,119
Just now... you called my name.

5
00:00:34,559 --> 00:00:36,999
Don't talk nonsense.

6
00:00:36,999 --> 00:00:38,559
I'm not talking nonsense.

7
00:00:38,559 --> 00:00:41,599
If you don't believe me,
let's go watch the playback.

8
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,960
What are you doing?

9
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,360
So many people are watching.

10
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:53,960
Don't mess around.

11
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:55,880
If you keep this up, I'll...

12
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,840
Does this count as messing around?

13
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:17,519
Mr. Zhen, Mr. Zhang.

14
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:24,360
Well, the next scene is for you two.

15
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:27,999
The director is waiting in the room
for you to rehearse the scene.

16
00:01:27,999 --> 00:01:29,499
Let's go.

17
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:38,400
It's okay, it doesn't hurt.

18
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,093
Time to rehearse.

19
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:13,199
[Episode 5]

20
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:17,520
As long as you beg me, I will fall for you.

21
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,719
Doctor.

22
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:20,440
Dr. Fang.

23
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:23,799
At this point, you can
just pull off his bathrobe,

24
00:03:23,799 --> 00:03:25,479
lean in, and kiss him.

25
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:28,759
Then it gets passionate in the back,

26
00:03:28,759 --> 00:03:30,920
letting him release in this wet dream.

27
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:33,720
This scene... is Gao Zhun's dream.

28
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:34,759
The whole scene

29
00:03:34,759 --> 00:03:37,999
must project Gao Zhun's feelings for Fang Chi.

30
00:03:37,999 --> 00:03:41,039
That suppressed physical longing,

31
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:42,160
the desire, the emotion...

32
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,759
it all has to be shown.

33
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:46,680
From the moment you see Fang Chi,

34
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:49,039
every second, every shot,

35
00:03:49,039 --> 00:03:50,440
must be surging with hidden tension.

36
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:51,519
Understand?

37
00:03:51,519 --> 00:03:52,520
Understood.

38
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,640
Mr. Zhen.

39
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:56,360
Your Fang Chi must feel like Pandora's box.

40
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:59,160
Be seductive, be aggressive.

41
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:02,319
Make Gao Zhun release all his emotions.

42
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:04,200
Come on. Set up another camera angle for me,

43
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:06,239
specifically to capture Gao Zhun's expression.

44
00:04:06,239 --> 00:04:08,140
Ready? Let's start.

45
00:04:12,279 --> 00:04:14,079
What are you doing?

46
00:04:14,079 --> 00:04:17,559
The director said to be aggressive.

47
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:23,080
You can't escape.

48
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,559
Cameras A and B, standby.

49
00:04:32,559 --> 00:04:33,920
Scene 28.

50
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,000
Shot 1, Take 1.

51
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,520
Action!

52
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:54,800
What are you doing here?

53
00:05:02,999 --> 00:05:04,960
Did you not want me to come?

54
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:07,160
Of course I...

55
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,559
No.

56
00:05:08,559 --> 00:05:10,279
I can't...

57
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:17,360
Finish your sentence.

58
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,439
Of course you what?

59
00:05:22,319 --> 00:05:24,319
Speak.

60
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:28,519
Or I won't let you see me
every Wednesday from now on.

61
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:30,159
I want to.

62
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,719
Of course I want to see you.

63
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:37,840
Then what was that "can't" about?

64
00:05:39,079 --> 00:05:41,240
You and me...

65
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:44,000
- We can't.
- So what?

66
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:47,559
Emotions are pure.

67
00:05:47,559 --> 00:05:52,400
If you want to, we can be together forever.

68
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:54,560
But how will the world...

69
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:58,385
look at us?

70
00:05:58,385 --> 00:06:02,320
What will happen to my life?

71
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:10,320
The world's judgment is terrifying.

72
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:16,120
But if you're willing, through heaven or hell,

73
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:18,240
I will be with you.

74
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:26,119
As long as you call my name,

75
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:29,080
I will fall for you.

76
00:06:30,492 --> 00:06:32,880
Doctor.

77
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:34,840
Dr. Fang.

78
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:41,480
I said...

79
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,600
my name.

80
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,800
Fang Chi.

81
00:06:49,559 --> 00:06:51,399
Fang Chi.

82
00:06:52,559 --> 00:06:54,199
Fang Chi.

83
00:06:55,599 --> 00:06:57,919
This is what you want.

84
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:01,500
That's why...

85
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,440
I'm here.

86
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:13,640
<i>That line about calling your name
and falling for you isn't in the script.</i>

87
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:15,999
<i>Director, should we go again?</i>

88
00:07:28,839 --> 00:07:31,440
Legs apart, impact, simulate entry.

89
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:33,160
It has to be realistic.

90
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:35,480
Gao Zhun, legs apart.
Fang Chi, simulate entry.

91
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,839
Focus on the impact and realism.

92
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,720
Gao Zhun, expose your neck.

93
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,880
Fang Chi.

94
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:53,274
More aggression and possessiveness.

95
00:07:53,274 --> 00:07:54,839
Be more intense.

96
00:08:46,759 --> 00:08:48,319
Fang Chi, move out of the frame.

97
00:08:48,319 --> 00:08:49,719
All right, keep the camera position.

98
00:08:49,719 --> 00:08:52,160
Mr. Zhang, stay still.
Mr. Zhen, move out of the frame.

99
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:00,440
Mr. Zhen, you need to move out of the frame.

100
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:02,920
We're filming Gao Zhun's reaction
after waking up.

101
00:09:04,839 --> 00:09:06,679
Cameras A and C stay.

102
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:07,919
Everyone else, clear the set.

103
00:09:07,919 --> 00:09:11,240
Also, have Mr. Zhen's assistant come in.

104
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:14,760
Got it. Everyone out, out, out.

105
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,600
Hey, you, don't leave.

106
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,600
- Do you have wet wipes?
- Yes.

107
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:21,020
- Take them to the actors.
- Sure thing.

108
00:09:42,279 --> 00:09:43,919
Take a look.

109
00:10:29,743 --> 00:10:31,259
Cut.

110
00:10:40,072 --> 00:10:41,960
Being professional is a good thing.

111
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:42,960
But...

112
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:46,000
I don't want to have to clear the set
for every scene from now on.

113
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:48,000
Can you still do the next one?

114
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,719
All right then.

115
00:10:51,719 --> 00:10:53,159
Let's push that scene back.

116
00:10:53,159 --> 00:10:55,359
You two take a break for today.

117
00:10:57,639 --> 00:10:58,640
Come on.

118
00:10:58,640 --> 00:11:00,400
Let's shoot the next scene first.

119
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:10,960
<i>"Fang Chi."</i>

120
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:13,360
<i>"As long as you call my name,"</i>

121
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:16,719
<i>"I will fall for you."</i>

122
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,800
Zhen Xin.

123
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:26,319
I heard it.

124
00:11:26,319 --> 00:11:28,080
Just now...

125
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:30,640
You called my name.

126
00:11:38,799 --> 00:11:41,065
You added that line on purpose.

127
00:11:42,319 --> 00:11:44,199
What is this?

128
00:11:45,199 --> 00:11:46,999
Are you getting back at me?

129
00:11:48,319 --> 00:11:50,000
Who is it?

130
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,680
Give me a second.

131
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:00,720
Is something wrong?

132
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,960
I wouldn't be here if there wasn't.

133
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:07,080
If you want the hotel CCTV
to film me for a bit longer,

134
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,880
I don't mind.

135
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:35,119
What are you thinking?

136
00:12:35,119 --> 00:12:36,520
What?

137
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:38,239
Me...

138
00:12:38,239 --> 00:12:40,199
About us.

139
00:12:40,199 --> 00:12:41,919
What are you thinking?

140
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:45,799
I just want to act well,

141
00:12:45,799 --> 00:12:48,119
to bring the character to life.

142
00:12:48,119 --> 00:12:50,759
Then why did you call my real name?

143
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:55,140
And why did you have a reaction to me?

144
00:12:58,080 --> 00:13:01,360
I fucking came on you,

145
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:04,000
and you're still talking about acting?

146
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:07,640
If it were just acting, would we be like this?

147
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:11,400
Acting is everything.

148
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:13,040
We...

149
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:15,040
We're just too immersed in the roles.

150
00:13:15,719 --> 00:13:17,480
Fine.

151
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:20,472
If that's what you want to say,
have it your way.

152
00:13:21,279 --> 00:13:22,959
What are you doing?

153
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,719
I saw it.

154
00:13:27,719 --> 00:13:29,680
I chafed your skin earlier.

155
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:31,040
You need medicine.

156
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,400
No need.

157
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:34,280
I'll do it myself.

158
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:37,800
You don't trust me.

159
00:13:39,759 --> 00:13:42,239
You have to trust me.

160
00:13:43,020 --> 00:13:45,563
You have to give yourself to me.

161
00:13:46,759 --> 00:13:50,199
After all, I am your Dr. Fang.

162
00:13:50,199 --> 00:13:51,699
Stop it.

163
00:13:52,679 --> 00:13:54,920
This is my room, not the film set.

164
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,400
Didn't you say it yourself?

165
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:57,839
You're too deep in the role.

166
00:13:57,839 --> 00:13:59,680
You forgot as soon as you said it.

167
00:14:00,759 --> 00:14:02,560
Now sit down.

168
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:04,440
I'm going to apply the medicine.

169
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:08,480
If you don't cooperate, I'll have to use force.

170
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,159
Go ahead then.

171
00:14:10,159 --> 00:14:12,440
Make me see the director
with a black eye again.

172
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:13,560
You...

173
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:19,040
You're a rogue.

174
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:56,720
Zhang Zhun!

175
00:15:05,679 --> 00:15:07,479
Ignore it.

176
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:09,839
Zhun!

177
00:15:09,839 --> 00:15:12,017
It's Xiao Deng! Open up!

178
00:15:17,559 --> 00:15:19,059
Zhun!

179
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:24,279
Mr. Zhen Xin!

180
00:15:24,279 --> 00:15:25,960
The Best Actor!

181
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:28,119
I'm so lucky to meet you.

182
00:15:28,119 --> 00:15:31,239
I'm Zhun's assistant, Xiao Deng.

183
00:15:31,239 --> 00:15:33,319
So, Lin Ze assigned you this assistant?

184
00:15:33,319 --> 00:15:35,000
I wasn't sent by his agent.

185
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,200
Dan Yi asked me to come.

186
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,440
Who?

187
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,719
Dan Yi.

188
00:15:40,719 --> 00:15:42,279
Xie Dan Yi.

189
00:15:42,279 --> 00:15:43,679
My girlfriend.

190
00:15:43,679 --> 00:15:45,040
Yeah, that's right.

191
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:47,080
She was worried Zhun wouldn't have
anyone to take care of him on set.

192
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:49,400
So, she sent me to Coconut City to help out.

193
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:50,480
By the way, Zhun!

194
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:52,799
She also asked me to bring you
some clean clothes.

195
00:15:52,799 --> 00:15:54,399
I'll get them for you.

196
00:15:55,400 --> 00:15:56,880
I'll let you two get back to it. I'm off.

197
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:58,799
Wait, I'll walk you out.

198
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:01,360
Have you arranged your accommodation?

199
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:03,560
Not yet.

200
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:05,400
But I can just crash with Zhun.

201
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:06,960
No.

202
00:16:13,119 --> 00:16:14,799
This is Director Chen's production.

203
00:16:14,799 --> 00:16:15,920
We have the budget.

204
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:18,069
We can't be so stingy that
an assistant has nowhere to stay.

205
00:16:19,719 --> 00:16:21,920
- I'll talk to the producer for you...
- Don't bother.

206
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:24,360
I'll arrange it myself.

207
00:16:27,159 --> 00:16:29,000
Xiao Deng snores.

208
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,279
The really loud kind.

209
00:16:30,279 --> 00:16:32,920
No one can sleep in the same room as him.

210
00:16:32,920 --> 00:16:35,320
I'll talk to the assistant director later.

211
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:37,040
Right, right.

212
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:39,880
Remember to apply the medicine.

213
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:42,399
I'll walk you out, Mr. Zhen.

214
00:16:42,399 --> 00:16:44,399
Take care, Mr. Zhen.

215
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:49,639
Zhun, why are you sighing?

216
00:16:49,639 --> 00:16:52,880
Is acting with the Best Actor that stressful?

217
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:55,480
Why did Dan Yi suddenly
send you to be my assistant?

218
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:58,440
She's afraid you'll be bullied
by the Best Actor.

219
00:16:58,440 --> 00:16:59,560
Did he bully you?

220
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:01,360
Be serious.

221
00:17:02,279 --> 00:17:03,360
I am being serious.

222
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:04,759
She said filming is hard work.

223
00:17:04,759 --> 00:17:06,119
You need someone to look after you.

224
00:17:06,119 --> 00:17:08,400
So, here I am.

225
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:09,439
Zhun.

226
00:17:09,439 --> 00:17:10,839
What were you and the Best Actor
busy with just now?

227
00:17:10,839 --> 00:17:13,120
Why did it take so long to open the door?

228
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:26,400
Rehearsing.

229
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,900
Rehearse...

230
00:17:48,799 --> 00:17:51,139
Cut! Good, moving on.

231
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:56,920
- Director Chen.
- Zhang Zhun.

232
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:58,600
What's going on with you today?

233
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:00,520
It's just a short 0.3-page transition scene,

234
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:03,000
but it took seventeen takes to pass.

235
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:04,719
Mr. Wu has a very tight schedule.

236
00:18:04,719 --> 00:18:06,400
You need to study the script and be ready.

237
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:08,640
This can't happen again.

238
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:10,360
Understood.

239
00:18:15,839 --> 00:18:18,040
I'll adjust my state.

240
00:18:18,040 --> 00:18:20,520
Director, don't worry.

241
00:18:20,520 --> 00:18:22,279
The schedule has been packed lately.

242
00:18:22,279 --> 00:18:23,279
He's just tired.

243
00:18:23,279 --> 00:18:25,839
Give him a break and he'll be fine.

244
00:18:25,839 --> 00:18:27,319
Mr. Zhang has indeed been working hard.

245
00:18:27,319 --> 00:18:30,199
And you, as his senior, are very caring.

246
00:18:30,199 --> 00:18:31,279
Tell you what,

247
00:18:31,279 --> 00:18:35,239
let's shoot the scene
with Fang Chi and Justin first.

248
00:18:35,239 --> 00:18:37,880
Let Mr. Zhang take a breather and get prepared.

249
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:39,040
Thank you, Director Chen.

250
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:41,400
Our director is the most considerate.

251
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:43,520
Flattery will get you everywhere.

252
00:18:43,520 --> 00:18:44,560
Switching to Scene 43.

253
00:18:44,560 --> 00:18:46,280
Actors, let's run through the scene.

254
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:51,199
Zhun.

255
00:18:51,199 --> 00:18:53,119
What's wrong with you today?

256
00:18:53,119 --> 00:18:55,640
I'm fine, Wu Rong.

257
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:00,360
Mr. Zhen.

258
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:02,279
Xiao Deng.

259
00:19:02,279 --> 00:19:04,839
When did he become your assistant?

260
00:19:07,553 --> 00:19:09,913
Dan Yi sent him to help me.

261
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,440
Oh.

262
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:15,760
So, she's worried about you.

263
00:19:17,607 --> 00:19:19,887
What's there to be worried about?

264
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:25,119
Zhun.

265
00:19:25,119 --> 00:19:26,759
Trust me.

266
00:19:26,759 --> 00:19:28,840
When it comes to relationships,

267
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:32,780
women are always more sensitive
than you can imagine.

268
00:19:33,719 --> 00:19:35,219
Besides...

269
00:19:41,319 --> 00:19:43,479
Can she really feel at ease?

270
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:55,239
Zhun.

271
00:19:55,239 --> 00:19:57,520
Remember what I said that night.

272
00:19:57,520 --> 00:20:00,799
Acting is just acting.

273
00:20:11,600 --> 00:20:12,960
Three, two, one.

274
00:20:12,960 --> 00:20:14,759
Action!

275
00:20:14,759 --> 00:20:16,599
So...

276
00:20:17,719 --> 00:20:20,519
You think your boss is interested in you?

277
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,520
Yes.

278
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:24,920
He's beautiful.

279
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:26,760
Very special.

280
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:32,880
I've noticed that he steals
glances at me sometimes.

281
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:38,679
Has he ever expressed it to you?

282
00:20:38,679 --> 00:20:40,040
Of course not.

283
00:20:40,040 --> 00:20:41,719
He's a conservative man.

284
00:20:41,719 --> 00:20:43,239
And he's our boss.

285
00:20:43,239 --> 00:20:47,439
But I know he's waiting for me to make a move.

286
00:20:52,520 --> 00:20:54,514
What's the age gap between you?

287
00:20:55,639 --> 00:20:57,159
Seven or eight years.

288
00:20:57,159 --> 00:20:59,319
But I grew up in Canada.

289
00:20:59,319 --> 00:21:02,000
That kind of age difference
is nothing over there.

290
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,799
You know?

291
00:21:03,799 --> 00:21:05,919
What do you want to do to him?

292
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:10,800
I want to...

293
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:15,919
find an opportunity to corner him.

294
00:21:17,119 --> 00:21:18,560
After all, for his sake,

295
00:21:18,560 --> 00:21:21,119
I even broke up with my girlfriend.

296
00:21:21,119 --> 00:21:25,119
Besides, now, I don't find
the same sex so repulsive.

297
00:21:25,119 --> 00:21:26,879
And after you corner him?

298
00:21:27,759 --> 00:21:29,679
What do you want to do?

299
00:21:42,765 --> 00:21:45,880
[Has threatening tendencies to his superior]

300
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:47,799
Let's stop here for today.

301
00:21:47,799 --> 00:21:50,199
Same time next week.

302
00:22:18,480 --> 00:22:20,639
Hello?

303
00:22:20,639 --> 00:22:22,239
Right now?

304
00:22:23,405 --> 00:22:25,083
The two of you.

305
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:28,080
Okay.

306
00:22:28,080 --> 00:22:29,580
See you in a bit.

307
00:22:35,759 --> 00:22:37,759
Where's Gao Zhun?

308
00:22:37,759 --> 00:22:39,199
He's not feeling well.

309
00:22:39,199 --> 00:22:40,239
Let's go.

310
00:22:40,239 --> 00:22:41,879
What's wrong with him?

311
00:22:42,679 --> 00:22:44,960
Do you care about him or me?

312
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:46,839
He's your boyfriend.

313
00:22:46,839 --> 00:22:48,440
We can break up.

314
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:51,160
I don't want to spend my life with a lunatic.

315
00:22:53,080 --> 00:22:54,360
Charles.

316
00:22:54,360 --> 00:22:56,400
You know how I feel about you.

317
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:59,000
I'm going on a European tour tomorrow.

318
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:02,639
Today, I just want to spend the day with you.

319
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:09,759
<i>Please don't leave me.</i>

320
00:23:09,759 --> 00:23:11,559
<i>Please.</i>

321
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:17,060
We have to go back.

322
00:23:17,060 --> 00:23:19,340
We can't leave him alone at home.

323
00:23:41,280 --> 00:23:44,639
This is "The Four Seasons"
by Giuseppe Arcimboldo.

324
00:23:44,639 --> 00:23:46,360
But this set isn't the original.

325
00:23:46,360 --> 00:23:48,401
Gao Zhun painted these copies.

326
00:24:06,479 --> 00:24:07,821
This is his bedroom.

327
00:24:07,821 --> 00:24:09,799
We sleep in separate rooms.

328
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:26,120
Mr. Gao.

329
00:24:26,120 --> 00:24:27,760
I'm coming in.

330
00:24:44,759 --> 00:24:46,359
Mr. Gao.

331
00:24:48,799 --> 00:24:51,799
Mr. Gao, won't you let me see you?

332
00:24:56,040 --> 00:24:57,199
Dr. Fang.

333
00:24:57,199 --> 00:24:59,123
I...

334
00:24:59,123 --> 00:25:00,803
I'm sorry.

335
00:25:01,560 --> 00:25:03,640
What happened?

336
00:25:04,799 --> 00:25:08,559
It's... It's Justin.

337
00:25:13,080 --> 00:25:15,159
It's okay.

338
00:25:15,159 --> 00:25:17,520
You're safe now.

339
00:25:17,520 --> 00:25:19,160
You can tell me.

340
00:25:20,639 --> 00:25:22,319
Yesterday...

341
00:25:24,879 --> 00:25:27,999
I took someone else
on a business trip instead of him,

342
00:25:28,919 --> 00:25:33,679
so he came to my office
and smashed everything in sight.

343
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:41,680
It's cooling outside.

344
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:44,120
Do you want to go for a walk?

345
00:25:48,680 --> 00:25:50,560
Just to keep me company.

346
00:25:50,560 --> 00:25:52,080
Okay?

347
00:26:00,080 --> 00:26:02,200
Did he hit you?

348
00:26:06,600 --> 00:26:07,879
No.

349
00:26:07,879 --> 00:26:10,040
It was... It was an art book.

350
00:26:10,040 --> 00:26:11,879
The art book hit me.

351
00:26:11,879 --> 00:26:13,679
It was very thick.

352
00:26:20,359 --> 00:26:22,480
This chair is a 19th-century antique.

353
00:26:22,480 --> 00:26:23,839
It's worth 70,000 US dollars.

354
00:26:23,839 --> 00:26:27,439
Usually, he doesn't even let me sit on it.

355
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:31,702
I'm sorry.

356
00:26:32,719 --> 00:26:34,440
You should have told me.

357
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:36,320
Do you like it?

358
00:26:36,320 --> 00:26:38,399
It's yours.

359
00:26:38,399 --> 00:26:39,759
There's no need.

360
00:26:39,759 --> 00:26:41,399
I don't understand art.

361
00:26:41,399 --> 00:26:43,640
Besides, if it weren't for you,

362
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:46,040
I wouldn't even sit on a chair like this.

363
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:56,799
Well, I'm going to get changed.

364
00:27:00,640 --> 00:27:02,480
Come and help me.

365
00:27:25,440 --> 00:27:26,839
Lin Lin, are you crazy?

366
00:27:26,839 --> 00:27:28,599
Gao Zhun is right inside.

367
00:27:36,279 --> 00:27:38,319
Zuo Lin Lin...

368
00:27:39,080 --> 00:27:40,640
I know.

369
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:44,720
You can't let me go, right?

370
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:56,760
Charles.

371
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:11,040
You were waiting for me here?

372
00:28:11,040 --> 00:28:12,440
Of course.

373
00:28:12,440 --> 00:28:14,680
Let's head out once you're ready.

374
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:17,200
Otherwise, it'll be dark soon.

375
00:28:18,279 --> 00:28:19,759
Let's go.

376
00:28:19,759 --> 00:28:21,259
Okay.

377
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:32,200
I haven't been this happy in a long time.

378
00:28:39,040 --> 00:28:40,800
Don't pity him.

379
00:28:41,440 --> 00:28:43,960
He's a selfish man.

380
00:28:43,960 --> 00:28:46,120
What?

381
00:28:46,120 --> 00:28:49,520
Do you think he really loves me?

382
00:28:50,799 --> 00:28:52,759
He doesn't.

383
00:28:52,759 --> 00:28:55,040
I'm just one of his collectibles.

384
00:28:55,040 --> 00:28:57,799
Just like that chair, and those paintings.

385
00:28:57,799 --> 00:28:59,879
There's no difference.

386
00:28:59,879 --> 00:29:02,719
He only loves himself.

387
00:29:03,359 --> 00:29:05,639
I'm the one you should pity.

388
00:29:35,919 --> 00:29:37,440
Charles.

389
00:29:38,160 --> 00:29:39,760
Charles.

390
00:30:20,919 --> 00:30:22,519
Found you.

391
00:30:24,839 --> 00:30:26,319
Let's go.

392
00:30:26,319 --> 00:30:28,039
Let's watch the fireworks together.

393
00:30:31,160 --> 00:30:33,000
You and Lin Lin...

394
00:30:35,120 --> 00:30:37,480
aren't just ordinary friends, are you?

395
00:30:50,600 --> 00:30:52,960
Is it because of her...

396
00:30:52,960 --> 00:30:54,559
that you...

397
00:30:57,319 --> 00:30:59,399
that you're so nice to me?

398
00:31:05,080 --> 00:31:07,000
She treats you like this.

399
00:31:07,919 --> 00:31:09,840
Why don't you break up?

400
00:31:17,759 --> 00:31:21,899
If I break up with her, will you...

401
00:31:24,199 --> 00:31:26,039
will you stop talking to me?

402
00:31:34,359 --> 00:31:35,985
Charles.

403
00:31:43,960 --> 00:31:45,880
You two should talk.

404
00:31:46,759 --> 00:31:48,639
I'll go get her.

405
00:32:09,600 --> 00:32:11,200
Gao Zhun.

406
00:32:23,160 --> 00:32:25,240
I was raped.

407
00:32:28,239 --> 00:32:30,020
By a man.

408
00:32:49,879 --> 00:32:51,520
Lin Lin is over there.

409
00:32:51,520 --> 00:32:54,600
Go to her. Don't worry about me.

410
00:32:56,199 --> 00:32:58,319
I'm not going.

411
00:33:02,399 --> 00:33:04,200
Come with me.

412
00:33:05,080 --> 00:33:06,680
Will you?

413
00:33:21,600 --> 00:33:23,880
Trust me.

414
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:25,681
Okay?

415
00:37:09,440 --> 00:37:10,839
Zuo Lin Lin.

416
00:37:10,839 --> 00:37:12,960
You're crazy.

417
00:37:12,960 --> 00:37:14,591
He's still inside.

